    "message": "Microsoft.UI.Reactor.ProjectTemplates is deprecated.\nThe Reactor templates now ship with the WinUI templates in Microsoft.WindowsAppSDK.WinUI.CSharp.Templates.\n\nTo switch:\ndotnet new uninstall Microsoft.UI.Reactor.ProjectTemplates\ndotnet new install Microsoft.WindowsAppSDK.WinUI.CSharp.Templates\n\nThen use \"dotnet new reactor\" instead of \"dotnet new reactorapp\". The pack also includes reactor-mvu, reactor-navview, reactor-tabview and reactor-singlefile.",
